# Monitoring Alert — `<Scenario Name>`

<!-- Replace this with the actual alert description. -->

A Bicep template that creates a metric alert targeting this scenario's App Insights resource.

## Deployment

```bash
az deployment group create \
  --resource-group rg-<scenario-slug> \
  --template-file scenarios/<scenario-slug>/infra/monitoring/alert.bicep \
  --parameters appInsightsName=<APP_INSIGHTS_NAME>
```
